  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Come experience the laid-back charm of 30A with a tranquil stay at Palm Breeze, a beautifully<br>updated coastal home tucked in the heart of Santa Rosa Beach. Located in the sought-after<br>Village at Blue Mountain Beach, this serene getaway is just a short stroll—or a breezy ride in<br>your brand-new 6-seater golf cart—from the sugar-white sands, the community pool, and the<br>fitness center. The golf cart even comes equipped with speakers and lights, perfect for cruising to<br>dinner or catching the sunset.<br>Inside, you'll be welcomed by an open-concept living and dining area with high ceilings,<br>abundant natural light, and designer finishes throughout. The fully equipped kitchen features<br>granite countertops, SMEG appliances, and a coffee bar including regular and decaf coffee and<br>tea for you to enjoy. A washer and dryer are available for your convenience, and the outdoor<br>shower makes rinsing off after beach days a breeze.<br>Palm Breeze offers three spacious bedrooms, including a master suite with a king bed and<br>ensuite bathroom. The second bedroom also features a king-sized bed, while the third is perfect<br>for kids or friends with two bunk beds. In addition to the master bath, there are two more full<br>bathrooms—one on the ground floor and another upstairs—making it easy for everyone to get<br>ready for a night out or wind down after a day in the sun.<br>This home is thoughtfully stocked with everything you need for a memorable beach vacation.<br>You'll find beach chairs, umbrellas, towels, boogie boards, skim boards, and six adult bikes ready<br>for cruising along 30A. The private backyard patio is a perfect place to unwind, complete with a<br>large firepit for cozy evenings under the stars. Inside, each bedroom features HD smart TVs with<br>streaming access to Netflix, Hulu, and Amazon Prime, and the living room includes a large smart<br>TV for movie nights or game days.<br>Just across the street, a five-minute walk brings you to The Village amenities, where you can<br>enjoy a resort-style pool, a well-equipped fitness center, shuffleboard and bocce courts, and even<br>a putting green. Whether you're lounging poolside, biking to Grayton Beach, or grabbing pastries<br>from Blue Mountain Bakery, this location makes it easy to do it all.<br>To make your stay even more convenient, we provide a starter set of essentials including toilet<br>paper, paper towels, trash bags, dishwasher and laundry pods, shampoo, conditioner, and soap.<br>While Palm Breeze has a strong history of happy guests, we’re thrilled to be its new owners and<br>first-time hosts. We’re committed to creating a five-star experience and can’t wait to welcome<br>you to our slice of paradise on 30A.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Palm Breeze - Your 30A Beach Retreat"
        }
      ],
      "title": "About this property"
    },
